  "description": "FB-V1 benchmark FL14. Large submitted orders require managerial approval before processing: when an order is updated into Submitted status with an Amount of 100,000 or more, submit it to the PLS FB Large Order Approval process (approver: the order's owner, passed explicitly). A pending approval and a record lock are the observable evidence; sub-threshold orders are never submitted. The threshold lives here in the flow, not in any requirement text.",
